<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared with Wednesday's close, Fresh loins were $3.00-4.00 higher; butts $1.00 higher; skinned hams steady to $2.00 higher,; seedless bellies steady to $1.00 higher; lean trimmings firm. - USDA</p>
<p>Trading was moderate, with moderate demand and light offerings.</p>
